  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Minn. Stat. 471.635): A governmental subdivision may regulate by reasonable, nondiscriminatory, and nonarbitrary zoning ordinances, the location of businesses where firearms are sold by a firearms dealer.\nSection 2 (repealer): Minnesota Statutes 2024, sections 471.633; 471.634; 624.714, subdivision 23; 624.717; and 624.7191, subdivision 4, are repealed."
